ult模型(了解即可)-2.DataVault模型组成部分" ><u><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" >2.Data Vault模型组成部分</span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span><a href=3D"#id-3.3DataVault模型(了解即可)-2.1中心表（Hub组件）" ><u><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;" >2.1中心表（Hub组件）</span></u></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span><a href=3D"#id-3.3DataVault模型(了解即可)-2.2链接表（Link组件）" ><u><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,255);=